{"id":"n1-150","title":"Verb ようがない","romaji":"〜you ga nai","jlptLevel":1,"shortExplanation":"Expresses 'no way to do something,' 'impossible to do'.","longExplanation":"〜ようがない is used to say that there's no way or method to do something, even if you wanted to.","formation":"Verb (masu stem) + ようがない","examples":[{"jp":"電車が混んでいて、動きようがない。","romaji":"Densha ga konde ite, ugoki you ga nai.","en":"The train is so crowded that I can't move.","words":[{"surface":"電車","vocabId":"1443530","reading":"でんしゃ"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"混んでいて","vocabId":"2849867","reading":"こんでいて","baseForm":"混む"},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"動き","vocabId":"1451180","reading":"うごき"},{"surface":"よう","vocabId":"1546200","reading":"よう"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":"2098290","reading":"ない"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[5,6,7]},{"jp":"彼はとても早く走るので、追いつきようがない。","romaji":"Kare wa totemo hayaku hashiru no de, oitsuki you ga nai.","en":"He runs so fast, there's no way I can catch up.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"とても","vocabId":null},{"surface":"早く","vocabId":"1404975","reading":"はやく","baseForm":"早い"},{"surface":"走るので","vocabId":"1402540","reading":"はしるので","baseForm":"走る"},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"追いつきよう","vocabId":"1588810","reading":"おいつきよう","baseForm":"追いつく"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":"2098290","reading":"ない"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[6,7,8]},{"jp":"私には理解しようがない。","romaji":"Watashi ni wa rikai shiyou ga nai.","en":"There's no way for me to understand it.","words":[{"surface":"私","vocabId":"1311110","reading":"わたし"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"理解","vocabId":"1549910","reading":"りかい"},{"surface":"しよ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"う","vocabId":null},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":"2098290","reading":"ない"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[]},{"jp":"どうやっても、これを直しようがない。","romaji":"Dou yatte mo, kore o naoshi you ga nai.","en":"No matter what I try, there's no way to fix this.","words":[{"surface":"どう","vocabId":"1451730","reading":"どう"},{"surface":"やっ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"やる"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"これ","vocabId":"1628530","reading":"これ"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"直しよう","vocabId":"1599390","reading":"なおしよう","baseForm":"直す"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":"2098290","reading":"ない"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[7,8,9]}],"formalityLevel":"neutral","usageNote":"\"There's no way to do X\" - describes a genuine impossibility, not just unlikelihood.","family":{"id":"unlikely-impossible","name":"Unlikely / Impossible","relatedPoints":["n1-122","n1-123","n2-066","n1-154","n2-160","n2-074","n2-150","n2-162","n3-121"]}}